# Cache epoch for the cmake-dep archive store (.github/actions/cmake-deps).
#
# The cache rolls forward on its own: the key is the enumerated dependency set, restore falls back
# to the newest entry under the prefix, and cmake-dep only downloads what is missing. Every stored
# archive is re-hashed before use and a corrupt one is refetched, so nothing here needs touching for
# ordinary pin changes or a bad entry.
#
# Bumping this file changes the key prefix, abandoning every existing entry outright (they age out
# after 7 days unused). For a one-off purge with no commit at all, run the "Purge caches" workflow
# (.github/workflows/cache-purge.yml), which deletes entries through the API.
1
